<div id="about" class="jumbotron">
<p>Eve online is a complex game, with many terms which have come into common usage. While there are a large number of sites out there which feature a lexicon of those terms, it's not their primary goal. EveLexicon.com is a site dedicated to gathering those terms, and putting them into an easily searchable format, so that people can find them, and learn what that guy on comms is yammering on about.</p>
